Package: remdb-server
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adduser
Description: High-performance embedded in-memory database server
 remdb-server is a high-performance embedded in-memory database server
 with the following features:
  * ACID transactions with WAL
  * SQL query execution
  * Vector indexes (HNSW, IVF)
  * Time-series storage
  * JSON document store
  * Role-based access control (RBAC)
  * PubSub messaging (UDP-based)
  * HA master-slave replication
  * ONNX model inference
  * JDBC protocol support
  * Prometheus monitoring
  * Milvus-compatible REST API
 .
 This package contains the remdb-server daemon and the remdbcli CLI tool.